Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（希佛堡 克里维斯的安之宅邸）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.71,0:42:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（林肯市教堂）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.20,0:02:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一 二 三 一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One two three… One two three…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.09,0:02:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One two three…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一 二 三 一 二 三 转圈儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}One two three… One two three… Turn…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 转圈儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord, turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下 并非如此 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady! This way! No, no, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.81,0:02:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来演示给您看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要这样 您看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comme sa! You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.68,0:02:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要风姿高雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}举手投足雍容雅贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is elegant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.94,0:03:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要清妙纤美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}投足举手非雅即美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything that is not elegant must be beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.64,0:03:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.57,0:03:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}许久未曾召见你 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen you for a good while. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not know the reason for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亦无人告之\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.85,0:03:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我身体抱恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现已无大碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I am better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.24,0:03:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.35,0:03:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信吾体欠安之时 你也寻得乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you found something to amuse yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}聊以自娱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I was away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.73,0:03:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对陛下朝思暮想 魂牵梦萦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed Your Majesty so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们可曾将礼物送达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope they gave you my gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}礼物怎可抵陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gifts are not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.11,0:03:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.93,0:04:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}汝乃吾妻之血亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a blood relative of my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.98,0:04:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 并鉴于你在法国位尊显贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}For that reason, and because you so distinguished yourself in France,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我决定授予你嘉德骑士勋位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've decided to make you a Knight of the Order of the Garter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可合你心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it please you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.73,0:04:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 在下感激不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am deeply grateful, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里大人 退下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵旨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要给你样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 真是美丽绝伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.92,0:05:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明日我要外出一段时日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going away tomorrow, for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但今晚我要你侍寝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tonight I will visit to your bedchamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为若你能喜结珠胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}For nothing would please me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将欣喜至极\N{\fnArial\fs30}than for you to conceive my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 这些人穷困潦倒 身患痼疾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, these poor, suffering subjects,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们乞哀告怜 已求得获准\N{\fnArial\fs30}they have begged leave to receive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接受陛下恩赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty's gift of grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.90,0:05:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下可否将尊手置于他们额头之上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if Your Majesty might consent to lay your hands upon them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求陛下施恩 求您了 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty. Please. Please. Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}籍上帝恩典 吾命汝病痊愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the Grace of God, I command you to be healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.84,0:06:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}籍上帝恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the Grace of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.55,0:06:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾命汝病痊愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I command you to be healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 求您施恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}籍上帝恩典 吾赐汝病痊愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the Grace of God, I command you to be healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.41,0:06:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有我 陛下 请求您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Your Majesty. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}籍上帝恩典 吾赐汝病痊愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the Grace of God, I command you to be healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty. Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}籍上帝恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the Grace of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾赐汝病痊愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I command you to be healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑您 陛下 谢陛下恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless you, Your Majesty. Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.83,0:07:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.23,0:07:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下恩典 谢陛下恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you, Your Majesty. Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.37,0:07:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下恩典 谢陛下恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you, Your Majesty. Thank you. Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下恩典\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.56,0:07:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑 陛下万福\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless you, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 小姐 非常精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo, my Lady. Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.52,0:08:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Majesty. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的出现 算是惊喜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I surprise you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 伊丽莎白公主 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady Elizabeth. - Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有礼物送你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的拉丁语学得如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is your Latin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我乐在其中 谢谢关心 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I enjoy learning it, thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您为我指派的家教 格林代尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Grindle, the tutor you gave me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.87,0:09:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是位一流的导师\N{\fnArial\fs30}is an excellent teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此书为罗马历史学家塔西佗所著\N{\fnArial\fs30}This book is by the Roman historian Tacitus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你现在读来尚有难度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you may find it difficult to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.17,0:09:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但值得花费精力一阅\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the effort will be worthwhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.97,0:09:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人若胸无点墨 生命便毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}For without knowledge, life is not worth having.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常感谢您 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.77,0:09:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直心怀感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:09:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每晚都感谢上帝赐您健康之躯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and thank God every night for your good health.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并坚信您会成为我们的明君 慈父\N{\fnArial\fs30}and trust you will be our good King, and father,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福泽千秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.05,0:10:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是来用晚膳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have come for supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望不会给您带来不便\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that doesn't inconvenience you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.39,0:10:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想食品间里定有可供您享用之物 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we may find something in the larder, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此甚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.11,0:10:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您正式的授勋仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your formal installation into the Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.91,0:10:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不日便会举行 萨里大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}will take place soon, my Lord Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.77,0:10:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下赐福在下为您打点一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King's grace has commanded me to prepare you for the event,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.05,0:10:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 我也非常乐意如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I am happy and willing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确信阁下深知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure your lordship is aware of the great significance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘉德勋位对陛下而言意义非凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}attached to the Order by His Majesty and the great honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.69,0:10:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受此隆恩 无上荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he conveys upon you by electing you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.65,0:10:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如您所知 只有国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know, the Order comprises of twenty-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和二十五名贵族 骑士才能获此殊荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}noble and valiant knights and their sovereign.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘉德勋位是英格兰的至高荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no greater honor in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.35,0:10:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人何须班门弄斧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lordship has no need to sell the Order to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.71,0:10:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您多久前受此勋位\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you belonged to the Order?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今年年初\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was elected earlier this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过几个月而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few months, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我父亲和家族四代\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father and four generations of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早已获得此项荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}have already belonged to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.02,0:11:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们用餐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你猜陛下是去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you suppose the King has gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.24,0:11:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据说明天有满月\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell me there's a full moon tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.45,0:11:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们也该狂野一番\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we shall all behave like lunatics.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对有些人而言 月亮代表着爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some, the moon is the planet of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想再见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如您所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.72,0:12:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何不让我将他带至我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I could bring him to my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由我在外守候 防止外人闯入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I could wait outside, in case anyone should come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在下只求陛下千万小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only urge Your Majesty to be careful when you…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心什么 罗彻福德夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, Lady Rochford?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.23,0:12:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为我不知如何与人偷情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think I know how to meddle with a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不令自己怀孕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}without conceiving a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下当为您的女儿们自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty should be proud of your daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两个都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是虎父无犬女\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do you a great credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.91,0:13:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽小姐为人严谨 冰雪聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lady Mary is very serious and religious but very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如其他女性一般 她总是表现得大智若愚\N{\fnArial\fs30}like some women, she likes to hide her intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.17,0:13:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而伊丽莎白小姐 她的智慧光彩夺目\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Lady Elizabeth, she cannot hide her intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.67,0:13:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会成为一位伟大的女性\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will be a great lady, I think…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿上帝遂我心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}if God so wills it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有样东西 我想还给陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something which I should like to return to Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的婚戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wedding ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我愿您将它打碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should like you to break it into pieces,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为它已毫无价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a thing of no value.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine? Sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你喜欢我们如此幽会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like our meeting like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.75,0:14:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you love me yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.97,0:14:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如何证明汝之心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me perceive by some token that you love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.40,0:14:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一亲芳泽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I kiss you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的凯瑟琳 芳泽已摘\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have kissed before, Katherine sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不足以表明心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does not mean that you love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那吾该如何是好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else can I show you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.53,0:15:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里伯爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord Surrey,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.27,0:15:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾现授予你嘉德骑士勋位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am commanded now to invest you with the Garter,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此供你于授勋仪式上佩戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you to wear at your installation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[古英语]心怀叵测者必自取其辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Honni soit qui mal y pense." Evil be to him who evil thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.13,0:15:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾等为嘉德骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most friendly Companions of this Order,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.28,0:15:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至善的同道中士\N{\fnArial\fs30}denominated from the Garter,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此向你 吾兄 吾友 吾士\N{\fnArial\fs30}have admitted you, their friend, brother, and companion,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.07,0:15:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虔诚宣誓 赐汝嘉德荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}in faithful testimony of which they impart and give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.38,0:16:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}望汝不负天意\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Garter, which God grant that you, deservedly receiving it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.45,0:16:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实至荣归\N{\fnArial\fs30}may rightly wear and use to the Glory of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 吾友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, my friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.11,0:16:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.73,0:16:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and companions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.86,0:16:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.35,0:16:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可知我一直对你心存感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I am very grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺从接受你我婚姻的取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}for raising no objection to the annulment of our marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出于我对女人的了解 令我颇感意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It runs rather counter to my experience of women.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.07,0:16:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 臣妾一片真心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, I can truly say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.59,0:16:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只望陛下诸事天行顺意\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I wish in all things to please you as my Lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.63,0:16:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以回报陛下的大恩大德\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bear testament to your good treatment of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也愿留在这片心有眷恋的土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to stay in this country that I already love as my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道法国大使如何描述你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what the French Ambassador wrote about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们拦下了他的信件\N{\fnArial\fs30}We intercepted his letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说英国人民对我们离婚深表遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said that our people much regretted our divorce,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.37,0:17:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽历时很短 你已赢得爱戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that in a short time you had won their love,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.61,0:17:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人民将你誉为最仁慈可人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that they esteemed you as one of the most sweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}善良和蔼的王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}gracious, and humane queens they had ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你现在已另有新后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have another queen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.09,0:17:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.03,0:17:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无可置疑的美貌\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is beautiful, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.61,0:17:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年轻而充满活力 你一定对她好生仰慕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And very young. Full of life. You must adore her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.14,0:18:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已尽职\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did your duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.33,0:18:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他实在教人忍无可忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's insufferable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}狂妄自大 目中无人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks us all his inferiors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}居然推他的亲属为后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, we did him the great favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧我们干得好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}of making a member of his family the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事在人为\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is made can sometimes be unmade-like a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.93,0:19:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么个为法 国王爱她如痴如狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}What chance is there? The King is besotted by her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.20,0:19:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 众人皆知 - 谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everyone knows that. - That may change.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不过是个天真无知的小傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seems to me nothing but a frivolous and stupid girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要你煞煞那个不可一世的伯爵的威风\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to teach the Earl a lesson in humility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.84,0:19:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟敢称我为狼女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be called a she-wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.50,0:19:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是大胆 高贵如你我家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}by no man, nor should you allow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.36,0:19:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也绝不应容忍他人的肆意恶意中伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}the slanders against our family to go unpunished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自然 我那亲爱的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely, my dear husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.93,0:19:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也可以暗中安排一些天灾人祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could arrange for some misfortune to befall him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.17,0:20:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好啊 我的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quite!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如你所见 我已被授予英格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you see, I have been received into the most noble,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最至高无上的贵族荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}most prestigious Order of the Garter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.67,0:20:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘉德勋位在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here indeed is the garter! "Honni soit qui mal y pense."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.61,0:20:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}居心叵测者必自取其辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil to him who evil thinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.67,0:21:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}金字良言 万分同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good motto. I agree with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快上酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ale, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.80,0:21:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘉德勋位重任在身\N{\fnArial\fs30}My responsibilities to the Order.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}致使我口渴难忍啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}have already made me dreadfully thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 好极了 大人 - 多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very fine, my Lord! - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.64,0:21:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 您究竟是如何承担得起这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}How in God's name did you afford all this, my Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.78,0:21:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我常常身无分文 但总是财运不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have often had no money, but I have never been poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.66,0:21:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}翠花 你想不想体验一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wench! How would you like to suck the cock of a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.96,0:21:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘉德骑士的神秘利器\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's a member of the Order of the Garter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的朋友怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would your friends say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要听风就是雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would tell me not to swallow stories like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.57,0:21:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.44,0:21:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是如此…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}单薄苍白\N{\fnArial\fs30}all naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.65,0:21:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此一来 增色不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, there, there. It is dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.32,0:21:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢了 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:21:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.13,0:22:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再上美酒 朋友们 不醉不休\N{\fnArial\fs30}More ale. Drink up, my friend. Drink up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.11,0:22:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们 巡游北方的计划搁置已久\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lords, we must before long agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.75,0:22:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得尽早筹划\N{\fnArial\fs30}on these plans for our much-delayed progress to the North.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.32,0:22:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随行大批随从 配备侍卫护送\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall take a large retinue, including men-at-arms,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.28,0:22:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鉴于我们的目标地\N{\fnArial\fs30}since we mean especially to visit those parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.92,0:22:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前不久刚刚起义造反\N{\fnArial\fs30}of our realm which, not long ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.54,0:22:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}悖逆他们无上的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}raise up and techagainst us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.73,0:22:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而这次我希望那里的愚民\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, this time we expect the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.58,0:22:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能够拜我国恩 归顺臣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}being pardoned by our grace, to make further submissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.82,0:22:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弃恶从善 迷途知返\N{\fnArial\fs30}in acknowledgments of their past depravities.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.50,0:22:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.18,0:22:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还意邀苏格兰国王 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is also our intention to invite James, King of Scots,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.66,0:22:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于九月与我们在约克郡会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}to meet with us at York in September.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.91,0:22:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.93,0:22:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.38,0:22:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下正在开会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King's in Council!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.89,0:22:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将运送上等挂毯和餐具事宜安排妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrange for the conveyance of our best tapestries and plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.25,0:22:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.35,0:23:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.70,0:23:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 凯瑟琳 你太无礼… - 我的经期推迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Katherine, you silly… - I have missed my bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.59,0:23:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我是怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I am with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.67,0:23:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我最亲爱的心肝…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sweet sweetheart…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.59,0:23:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还请陛下恕罪 刚才惹您生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to tell Your Majesty. I am sorry I made you angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.18,0:23:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有生气 我怎会生你的气呢 决不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not angry. How could I be any bit angry? God forbid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.78,0:23:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳 听我说 请听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine, listen to me, listen to me. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.02,0:23:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的宝贝 为了我们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the sake of our child, please, girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.00,0:23:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要过度兴奋 还是回房休息去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't excite yourself. Go and lay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.95,0:23:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保养好身子 我很快便会去看望你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest, and I will come and see you very, very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.31,0:23:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.15,0:23:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.55,0:24:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我美丽娇艳的王后 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My beautiful young Queen. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.11,0:24:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我父王近来可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.71,0:24:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回禀公主 国王陛下身疾已愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King, having recovered from his recent illness,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.61,0:24:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}近来气色甚佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}seems in much better humor, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.13,0:24:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下正在筹划巡游\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is planning to make a progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.49,0:24:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}北部疆域\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the North of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.09,0:24:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那边局势动荡 事端层出不穷\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great deal of work is already instigated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.19,0:24:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听说绣工们使用教士的长袍\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say that embroiderers are working on furniture.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.96,0:24:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和从教堂剥取的饰物来装饰家具\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tapestries using copes and ornaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.85,0:24:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并绣制挂毯\N{\fnArial\fs30}stripped from the churches, alas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.58,0:24:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}歇息一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.24,0:25:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.57,0:25:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有另外一个原因使陛下心舒体适\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is another reason why the King's humor is improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.92,0:25:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}风传王后陛下已喜怀龙种\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are rumors. The Queen is thought to be with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.52,0:25:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如她果真能产下一位约克公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure His Majesty would be overjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.69,0:25:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信陛下定会喜出望外\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she produced a Duke of York.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.30,0:25:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从另一方面说\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.85,0:25:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如她未能孕产 那么继位的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she does not, then the succession may,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.61,0:25:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能会变得玄机难卜\N{\fnArial\fs30}in fact, remain an open question.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.29,0:25:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此话怎讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.69,0:25:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华理应是第一顺位继承人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely Edward is first in line? Who could doubt it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.75,0:25:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Mary,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.69,0:25:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朝中要臣告与我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}certain important people at court have told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.51,0:25:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们一直对爱德华王子的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}they feel a "Scruple" Of conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.85,0:26:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简王后抱有迟疑态度 因她不像您的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the fact that Prince Edward's mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.28,0:26:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯塞琳王后那般名正言顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen Jane, was never ever formally crowned,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.69,0:26:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她从未被正式加冕过\N{\fnArial\fs30}unlike your own mother, Queen Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.39,0:26:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此有传言称 陛下有意在约克郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the rumor also goes, that the King intends to crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.12,0:26:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为新王后加冕 此后如她果真孕续龙脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}his new Queen at York, so if she has a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.11,0:26:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其子铁定无疑会成为王位的继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one can question his legitimacy or right to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.39,0:26:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 如果她未能孕产皇子的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if she does not have a son…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.26,0:26:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 那样一来您便更有把握问鼎王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. It would strengthen your own claim to the crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.54,0:26:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些朝中要臣还跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why these certain people at court have assured me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.97,0:26:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们日夜企盼 不仅为了倒覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}how they pray, pray, not only for the overthrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.64,0:26:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如赫福德之流的改革派 更是祈望\N{\fnArial\fs30}of vile reformers like Hertford, but for the day and the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.60,0:26:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有朝一日 您可登临王位 母仪天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Your Grace succeeds to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.36,0:26:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但顺天意 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if God wills it, Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.63,0:26:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但顺天意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if God wills it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.96,0:26:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天意已决 玛丽公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}But He must will it, Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.39,0:26:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今社稷局艰 隐忧惶存 长此以往 国将不国\N{\fnArial\fs30}For how else will this country ever be restored to obedience.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.29,0:27:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}试问此刻还有谁能力挽危澜 安顺民心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to faith? Otherwise, as things are,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.81,0:27:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重树帝国威信\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will go to the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.23,0:27:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再和我说说这次出行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me more about the progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.74,0:27:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要到哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.92,0:27:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先去往赫福德\N{\fnArial\fs30}First to Hatfield,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.05,0:27:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后经邓斯特布尔 安特希尔和格拉夫顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}then to Dunstable, Ampthill, and Grafton,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.66,0:27:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一路飞鹰走犬 好不快活\N{\fnArial\fs30}hunting and hawking along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.77,0:27:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后去斯坦福 再及林肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then to Stamford, and then Lincoln,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.79,0:27:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后是波士顿和约克郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so on to Boston and Yorkshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.99,0:27:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此番出行 一路定会有诸多庆典及盛宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll have to have plenty of new dresses made,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.93,0:27:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要备足新衣 华艳出席\N{\fnArial\fs30}for there will be many great occasions and banquets along the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.15,0:27:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}众人皆会为你的瑰丽而倾倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and great crowds will come to see your magnificence.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.17,0:27:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我太兴奋了 所有一切都如同一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so excited. All of this seems to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.75,0:27:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只愿长眠不愿醒来的佳梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}still like a dream, from which I hope never to wake!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.51,0:27:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚您要来临幸与我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you come to my bedchamber tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.83,0:27:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 亲爱的 如今你身怀有孕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sweetheart. It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.40,0:27:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}not while you're with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.15,0:28:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了 你不是已怀有我的血脉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter? You are with child?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.09,0:28:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.00,0:28:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我 我弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I miss…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.50,0:28:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.73,0:28:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.92,0:28:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡尔佩珀大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Culpepper,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.80,0:28:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我多想委身于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heartily recommend me unto you…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.61,0:29:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又不知君心何意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praying you send me word how that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.08,0:29:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若你此时在我身旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would you were with me now that you might.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.57,0:29:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}便知我柔肠寸断 泣难下笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}see what pain I take in writing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.82,0:29:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我听闻你抱恙在身 恨不得胁下生翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I heard that you were sick. And never longed so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.39,0:29:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不顾一切见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}"for anything as to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.74,0:29:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每每想起你不能常伴左右 我便心碎不已「\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes my heart die to think I can't always be in your company."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.43,0:29:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每每想起\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes my heart die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.66,0:29:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能常伴左右 我便心碎不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}to think I cannot always be in your company. Yours…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.14,0:29:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你至死不渝的凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours as long as life endures, Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.81,0:29:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不是她的错 她太年轻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not her fault. She's so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.74,0:29:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 就是她的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That is her fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.73,0:31:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你水平不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.32,0:31:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得你过去可不怎么会玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't used to, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.60,0:31:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我过去也不会喝酒 不懂乐器\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I never used to drink wine, or play music.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.55,0:31:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而现在我什么都会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I do all those things…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.76,0:31:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且很喜欢 我自由自在 想做就做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I like to do it. I am free, and I like to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.88,0:31:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今夜能与你共寝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I come to your bed tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.14,0:31:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在这儿呢 可不愿见你心碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here now. I don't want your heart to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.62,0:32:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是如此可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.51,0:32:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迷人的小傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sweet little fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.67,0:32:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.69,0:32:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你绝不能… 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mustn't… you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.02,0:32:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.32,0:32:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.98,0:34:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.05,0:34:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布莱恩女士求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.98,0:34:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty. My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.99,0:34:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的儿子 爱德华王子在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is your son, Prince Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.83,0:34:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 叔父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty. Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.83,0:34:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.50,0:34:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.53,0:34:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们可有精心照料你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you are well looked after.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.37,0:34:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}待你和善可亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everybody is kind to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.13,0:34:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.85,0:34:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有礼物送你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.36,0:35:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.76,0:35:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要离开伦敦数日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go away from London for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.91,0:35:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过你叔父留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your uncle will stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.60,0:35:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}务必照顾好他 布莱恩女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is to be kept warm and well at Windsor, Lady Bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.17,0:35:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万一你生病了 但愿不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if, heaven forbid, you should fall ill,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.66,0:35:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就给他用这个 这是我的特效药\N{\fnArial\fs30}dose him with this. It's my own concoction.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.22,0:35:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你身上有你母亲的影子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see your mother in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.60,0:35:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道她是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know who she was?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.38,0:35:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.65,0:36:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是她的顶针\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is her thimble.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.64,0:36:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.89,0:36:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的剑 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sword, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.63,0:36:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.73,0:36:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后陛下 国王驾到\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady, the King is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.94,0:37:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳 我是来通知你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katherine, I've come to tell you that we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.48,0:37:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两日内我们即启程前往白厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving Whitehall in two days time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.33,0:37:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信你已准备妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you are prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.36,0:37:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.41,0:37:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}忘了告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I've also come to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.01,0:37:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽公主与我们同行\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Lady Mary will be accompanying us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.80,0:37:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.29,0:37:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她一定要去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must she come?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.25,0:37:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然你不清楚状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.30,0:37:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽在北部深受爱戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary is a much-loved figure in the North,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.43,0:37:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于我们此行的目的大有裨益\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we mean to impress our subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.20,0:37:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此事已决 你无权过问\N{\fnArial\fs30}The decision has nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.71,0:37:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉没有怀上龙种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I was not with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.25,0:37:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定能怀上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure I can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.52,0:38:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}扬起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.14,0:38:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.83,0:38:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 拢起来 - 丢上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gather it up! - Hay up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.55,0:38:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.91,0:38:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保持队形 跟紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep in line! Fall in!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.40,0:38:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.62,0:38:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前进 跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving! Keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.80,0:39:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是国王的队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.04,0:39:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是国王 - 是玛丽公主和国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The King! - Lady Mary and the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.80,0:39:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你瞧 他们多么爱戴我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see how much they love us?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.64,0:39:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们可是正宗的英格兰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the real people of England.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.08,0:39:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们拥戴国君\N{\fnArial\fs30}They love their King.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.28,0:40:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加德纳主教大人到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Grace, Bishop Gardiner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.91,0:40:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 希望没有打扰您\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord. I trust I am not disturbing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.82,0:40:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下出宫 我深知您重担在肩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you bear a heavy burden, in His Majesty's absence.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.68,0:40:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有打扰 主教大人 欢迎您的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all, Your Grace. You are most welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.91,0:40:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 国王那边进展如何 - 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How goes the King's progress? - Most excellently.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.76,0:40:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他所到之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has been warmly and graciously received.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.45,0:40:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}民众欢声雷动\N{\fnArial\fs30}everywhere he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.63,0:40:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下也满载而归\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he has had good sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.10,0:40:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在上周 陛下还与其同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just last week he and his companions.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.66,0:40:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在区区两日内捕获了四百多只鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}shot over four hundred deer in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.56,0:40:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此刻他们在回林肯郡途中\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're now on their way to Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.72,0:40:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下精神安好 吾甚为高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very glad to hear His Majesty is in such good spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.60,0:40:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.86,0:40:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下定会指定萨里伯爵一同前往\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would number among his companions the Earl of Surrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.71,0:40:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.97,0:40:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 臣告退 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My Lord. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.90,0:40:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收到一些关于伯爵言行举止的揭发信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have received more reports of the Earl's behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.70,0:40:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被封为嘉德勋爵士后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems that, after his investiture into the Order of the Garter,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.43,0:40:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨里伯爵曾在领土的某个小酒馆内\N{\fnArial\fs30}he appeared in a tavern in his regalia…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.33,0:40:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公然取笑嘉德勋位及其所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and made great fun of the Order and of those belonging to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.40,0:41:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至当着鸨母和皮条客的面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even before bawds and pimps.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.35,0:41:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些证词是否确凿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these are sworn statements of his behavior?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.78,0:41:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千真万确 大人会深入调查吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are, my Lord. Are you going to investigate further?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.70,0:41:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.47,0:41:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十分感谢大人提供此等重要信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am most grateful to Your Grace for this information.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.90,0:41:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些信息终有一天会派上用场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust that someday you will use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.98,0:41:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我十分确信萨里及其随从\N{\fnArial\fs30}For I am as convinced as I can be that Surrey and his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.11,0:41:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公然藐视禁食律例\N{\fnArial\fs30}flout the fasting laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.68,0:41:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是狂热的路德派教徒以及圣餐论者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and are fanatic Lutherans and Sacramentarians.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.42,0:41:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信奉此等异端邪说者\N{\fnArial\fs30}for which damnable heresies.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.24,0:41:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理应在伦敦肉市场施以火刑示众\N{\fnArial\fs30}they ought to be burned at Smithfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.05,0:41:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.54,0:41:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}左 左右 左右 左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left, left, right, left, right, left, right…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.51,0:43:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利 承蒙天恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, by the Grace of God,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.76,0:43:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为英格兰 爱尔兰以及法兰西的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}King of England, Ireland, and France,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.80,0:43:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更为上帝之宠儿 教会之领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}also God's high minister here, Head of His Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.33,0:43:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}举国之灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and soul of the whole Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.18,0:43:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此我们虔诚地恳求您\N{\fnArial\fs30}We beseech you in all humility.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.03,0:43:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赐予人民以活力 治理和拯救世人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to animate, rule, and save your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.27,0:43:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾等亦向上天祈求 望其仁慈为怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we further pray God, of his infinite mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.72,0:43:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保佑凯瑟琳王后以及玛丽公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he will bless and maintain in faith, in love, and in fecundity.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.27,0:44:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永保信实 关爱与多子多福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen Katherine and your blessed daughter, Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.54,0:44:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.53,0:44:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.49,0:44:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.27,0:44:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}林肯郡的子民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}People of Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.50,0:44:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想必在场的诸位一定记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I need to remind you many of you here and about rose up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.77,0:44:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尔等非法起义 逆天而行\N{\fnArial\fs30}in an unnatural and unlawful rebellion against your King,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.39,0:45:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们理应顺应天意 服从国君\N{\fnArial\fs30}who you, by the laws of God, are bound to obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.37,0:45:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今日吾等齐聚一堂 并不为此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, today we come here for an altogether different reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.84,0:45:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是祈求上帝宽恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today we come here on a Pilgrimage of Forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.63,0:45:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾等聚集此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.62,0:45:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祈求上帝宽恕汝等既往的罪过与悖逆\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pardon all our subjects for their past sins and disobedience.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.39,0:45:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尔等之爱戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since we have seen how much you love us,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.69,0:45:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与忠诚展露无余\N{\fnArial\fs30}and seen all your tokens and signs of loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.24,0:45:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吾等豁达大度 宽恕你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a free heart we forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.36,0:45:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此处为陛下寝室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is Your Majesty's bedchamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.80,0:46:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那这通向何处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does this go?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.78,0:46:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卫生间\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Stool Chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.43,0:46:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.34,0:46:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通向后楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the backstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.21,0:46:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来啊 我想看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! I want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.81,0:46:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后面是何处\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's behind here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.96,0:46:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王陛下的寝室\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Majesty's bedchamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.67,0:46:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的侍从在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}With his servants?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.45,0:47:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很糟吧 托马斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks bad, doesn't it, Thomas?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.90,0:47:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已有所好转 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen it better, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.38,0:47:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我还是要清洗一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll bathe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.84,0:47:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚我本想临幸王后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to visit the Queen tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.66,0:47:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今日在教堂内 她是何等的纯洁美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looked so pure and beautiful in the cathedral today.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.79,0:47:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.79,0:47:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尔等均气度不凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were both magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.48,0:47:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人民如此仰慕崇拜陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the people adored and worshipped Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.42,0:47:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此般盛况吾前所未闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}such as I have never seen the like.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.40,0:47:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下是否就寝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think the King's asleep yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.58,0:47:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他定是晚睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.88,0:47:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 已近午夜 - 他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's almost midnight. - Oh! Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.12,0:48:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下已就寝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has gone to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.67,0:48:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快召他前来 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and fetch him. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.36,0:48:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.57,0:48:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快帮我更衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me change out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.42,0:48:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是谁 - 巡夜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's that? - The night watchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.76,0:48:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.94,0:48:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我留守此处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.48,0:48:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去门口守候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll watch outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.59,0:49:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.64,0:49:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where then?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.63,0:49:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.78,0:50:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
